  "ANS_SRC_4" [label="(5,0,0) radiation-pressure acceleration: However, limitations, including the lack of a long acceleration structure , deflection of protons by the self-generated magnetic field , and dephasing of the fastest protons during acceleration , lead to a proton energy below 100 MeV in experiments , ,  except one."];
